#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/quickstart.md:30
#: e68753725b854d93963a1750cf977a8e
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Acceptation humaine"

#: ../../docs/tools/tesla-workbench/quickstart.md:32
#: f8b523f4c4fd48e19b432ac487ed27b3
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspectez la sortie, les journaux, les resultats de tests et le diff. "
"Acceptez, demandez une correction, placez en quarantaine ou arretez; ne "
"promouvez jamais silencieusement un resultat genere."
